+        // width forever while `cols` shrank underneath them. A later widening then copies
+        // those stale cells back into the visible grid — under tmux, which lives in the alt
+        // buffer and repaints only deltas, that is stale text appearing inside the wrong
+        // pane and surviving a window switch.
+        // Must stay AFTER reflow: reflow rewraps from the OLD width.
